<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave B — resource ThingDefs the 6 species need: eggs
  (Dewback, Acklay, Porg, Nuna all lay eggs via CompProperties_EggLayer), leathers
  and species meats (all 6), and the two butcherBodyPart trophies (RSW_AcklayClaw,
  RSW_WampaSkull).

  Ported verbatim from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's
  ThingDefs_Items/Items_Resource_swanimal_Items.xml, each defName flat-RSW_-prefixed.
  texPath values are UNCHANGED text (swresource/EggSaurian, swresource/Leather_Fur,
  etc.) — the shared category textures these leathers/meats/eggs point at were
  extracted to the same relative Textures/swresource/ path the donor used, so no
  re-pathing was needed (same pattern as RSW_Bantha's own resources). Several
  species SHARE a texture (e.g. Reptomammal_Meat serves both Wampa and, in a later
  wave, Tauntaun) — that sharing is the donor's own, not introduced here.

  RSW_Saurian_Meat/RSW_Crustapod_Meat/RSW_Tough_Meat/RSW_Reptomammal_Meat/
  RSW_Reptavian_Meat/RSW_Mammavian_Meat parent RSW_SWanimals_RawMeatBase — the
  abstract base ALREADY renamed under Wave A (RSW_Bantha_Items.xml) rather than a
  second copy of it; do not reintroduce the bare "SWanimals_RawMeatBase" spelling.
-->
